settings-player-embedded = Embedded MPV · Linux Vulkan
settings-player-backend-help = Restart JellyPilot to apply. Linux defaults to Embedded playback with the pinned mpv fork and a 10-bit Vulkan surface; unsupported systems cannot use it. External MPV keeps its configuration, scripts and shaders. Other platforms use External MPV. The fields below configure external MPV only.
settings-mpv-path-placeholder = Auto-detect from PATH
settings-mpv-args-placeholder = Additional MPV arguments
settings-mpv-path = Executable path
settings-mpv-path-help = Leave empty to discover MPV from PATH. Applies to future MPV process starts.
settings-mpv-args = Extra arguments
settings-mpv-args-help = Whitespace-separated arguments. Applies to future playback starts.
settings-target-name = Playback target name
settings-target-name-help = Saved names are re-registered with the connected server immediately.
settings-intro = Intro skipper
settings-intro-help = Automatic skips detected intros; Manual shows the skip action; Off disables it.
