settings-intro-automatic = Automatic
settings-intro-manual = Manual
settings-season-volume = Remember volume per season
settings-season-volume-help = Automatically saves player volume for each season on this device, separately for each server and account. Uses MPV startup volume when no memory exists. Turning this off stops saving and restoring without deleting memories or changing the current volume.
settings-original-audio = Prefer original-language audio
settings-original-audio-help = Automatically selects the audio track matching the title's original language when playback starts. On current Jellyfin and Emby servers it needs the TMDb API key below. Audio tracks you pick manually for a series or movie are remembered and take precedence.
settings-tmdb-api-key = TMDb API key
settings-tmdb-api-key-help = Looks up a title's original language from TMDb because current Jellyfin and Emby servers do not expose it. Create a free key in your TMDb account settings. Empty disables the lookup.
